# Semantic annotations for NFSv3.
#
# The XDR is RFC 1813, assembled and pinned by SOURCES.  This file names
# things; it never states a field, offset or width.
notice Derived from the XDR of RFC 1813 (Sun Microsystems, 1995), assembled
notice by rule from the pinned RFC text into nfs3.x; see
notice THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md.
family nfs3
program NFS_PROGRAM NFS_V3
procedure-prefix NFSPROC3_
leaf args result
status-type nfsstat3
source nfs3.x
# Every other case label keeps its lowercased XDR name (nfs3err_perm, ...).
branch NFS3_OK ok
